_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-16T12:58:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-16T12:58:39Z","body":"> 英文界面，要生成中文，如何配置？\n\n同样好奇😯 ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/2976562105/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4728371034","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/579#issuecomment-4728371034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/579","id":4728371034,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc8AAAABGdU3Wg","user":{"login":"JaneYork","id":29787967,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5Nzg3OTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29787967?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork","html_url":"https://github.com/JaneYork","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JaneYork/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T09:49:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T09:49:47Z","body":"> 英文界面，要生成中文，如何配置？\n\n---\nalwaysApply: true\nscene: git_message\n---\n\n# Git 提交信息规范\n\n生成 Git 提交信息时，必须遵循以下规则：\n\n1. **使用中文**编写提交信息\n2. **格式**：`<类型>(<范围>): <简要描述>`\n\n## 类型说明\n\n| 类型     | 说明           | 示例                              |\n| -------- | -------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| feat     | 新功能         | feat(日志): 集成 tauri-plugin-log |\n| fix      | 修复 bug       | fix(菜单): 修复清缓存不生效的问题 |\n| refactor | 重构（非功能） | refactor(存储): 改用 Store 插件    |\n| docs     | 文档           | docs: 更新 CLI 使用说明           |\n| style    | 代码格式       | style: 统一缩进风格               |\n| test     | 测试           | test: 添加单元测试               |\n| chore    | 构建/工具      | chore: 更新依赖版本               |\n| perf     | 性能优化       | perf(窗口): 优化启动速度          |\n| ci       | CI/CD 配置     | ci: 添加 macOS 构建流水线         |\n\n## 要求\n\n- 第一行不超过 **72** 个字符\n- 类型和描述之间用冒号和空格分隔\n- 描述使用中文，简洁明了\n- 如需补充说明，在空行后写详细描述\n- 范围（括号内）为可选项，根据实际改动决定是否添加\n\ntrae示例：\n\n[git-commit-message.md](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29041588/git-commit-message.md)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4728371034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}